.3) whether field names change. AC6 Update User.java entity model: remove embedded Address, replace with separate CustomerProfile entity/table mapping.  Developer Notes  • This is a breaking change to the User JPA entity — coordinate with whoever owns TS-01.3 (registration UI) since request/response shape may change. • Should land before TS-DEVOPS-02 (architecture split) extracts Identity Service, so the extracted service starts from the correct schema.  Layer(s): Backend, Database     Dependencies: TS-01.1, TS-01.2 (supersedes/extends their data model)  ---  Sprint Plan Context (Sprint 5–11 Delivery Plan)  Sprint 6. BR-01 cleanup — also referenced as the underlying users/user_role table this sprint's Identity Service migration (widening user_role to include ANALYST) builds on top of.
